    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-verbĕro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to strike severely, to beat, bruise</i>
			(post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faciem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					13, 22, 43, § 126</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					7, 2, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitia,</span>”
				<i>to chastise</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 121, 4</span></i>
			; cf. id. Ira, 3, 20, 1.</div>
